relatedIssues.fixHint:
Find the synchronous work that held the UI isolate (214ms): a long loop, JSON decoding, file or database reads, or image processing in a widget build or a callback (a tap handler, a timer, a stream listener). A slow build also shows as heavy_compute. Move the work off the UI isolate:
final result = await Isolate.run(() => parseJson(data));
or split it into smaller pieces that yield between them.

Rebuilding widgets took 25.3% of UI-thread time. Shrink what rebuilds each frame. Use const constructors for static widgets:
const MyWidget({super.key});
Extract child widgets, or scope rebuilds with Selector or Consumer instead of BlocBuilder or Provider.of.

